<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Unihold says talks still continuing.</title>
<headline>Unihold says talks still continuing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unihold Ltd said on Monday it was still involved in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>Unihold first announced the talks on January 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
